Lab Report: Model comparison","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s1","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s2","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"All experiments were run on a single GPU with 12 GB of memory.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s3","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s4","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s5","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"S854 >","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s6","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"754","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s7","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Dataset","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s8","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"On SST-2, EffNet obtains a test accuracy of 48.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s9","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"As shown in Figure 1(a), MLP reaches between 63% and 70% test accuracy on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s10","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Ours reaches 81.4% validation accuracy at epoch 4 (Figure 1(b)).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s11","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"MLP reaches 91.4% validation accuracy at epoch 4 (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s12","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Ours reaches about 80% validation accuracy at epoch 4.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s13","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"The validation accuracy of MLP reaches its highest value of 82.9% at epoch 3.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s14","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s15","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"1.0","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s16","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"0.8","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s17","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":">","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s18","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"0.6","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s19","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"as} ® 0.4 ay","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s20","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":">","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s21","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"°","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s22","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"0.0","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s23","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Dataset","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s24","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"ResNet-50 achieves 53.4% validation accuracy on Fashion-MNIST (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s25","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"RN50 outperforms Baseline by about 5 percentage points on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s26","report_id":"v3f