50 has a loss of about 0.9 at epoch 20.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img4","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s41","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Baseline peaks at 0.665 loss at epoch 40.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img4","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_011_s42","report_id":"v3feat_011","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"img4","figure_id":null}]}